	(text "TWO MCP23017 I/O EXPANDERS ON THE SYSTEM-5 BUS" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "59e061f6-7b1a-5cff-ac12-4269b598de6a"))
	(text "U1 (0x20): GPA0-6 = D0-D6, GPB0-6 = A0-A6. U2 (0x21): GPA0-6 = D7, A7, TPA, TPB, -MRD, -MRW, -VMA;\nGPB0-6 = Q, -RESET, -INT, -EF, N0-N2. GPA7/GPB7 are output-only: SPARE1-4. No buffers: a pin is an input (monitor)\nor drives the line; -RESET, -INT, -EF are only pulled low or released." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d45b583f-bd0e-5ef4-8f98-25ddd390063b"))
